    "openmp_fix": "LightGBM and XGBoost each ship their own libomp; on macOS a process that has already initialised torch's libomp deadlocks at 0 % CPU when the second of them starts a thread pool. Fixed by adding torch/lib to the rpath of lib_lightgbm.dylib and libxgboost.dylib (and re-signing) so one libomp serves all three, plus OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 and n_jobs=4 for both boosters.",
